  - id: magnet
    name: "D\xE2y Chuy\u1EC1n H\xFAt Ng\u1ECDc"
    category: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7039fe009a1ae4bc7be6c1cab4bca63a, type: 3}
    tagText: "[ N\u1ED8I T\u1EA0I - PH\u1EA0M VI H\xDAT NG\u1ECCC ]"
    maxLevel: 5
    overview: "C\u1ED5 v\u1EADt t\u1EEB t\xEDnh t\u1ECFa ra l\u1EF1c h\xFAt ma thu\u1EADt
      m\u1EA1nh m\u1EBD, k\xE9o to\xE0n b\u1ED9 ng\u1ECDc kinh nghi\u1EC7m r\u01A1i
      t\u1EEB xa bay th\u1EB3ng v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa Ph\xE1p S\u01B0."
